{"case_id":"HN001","original_question":"最近血壓都量得正常，我能不能把每天的降血壓藥改成隔天吃？","arm":"B","round":1,"run_status":"completed","fail_code":null,"care_output":"不行，慢性病用藥應遵照醫囑按時規律服藥，不得任意增減藥量 [1][2][3]。若血壓控制良好或出現低血壓情況，應提供血壓量測記錄表與醫師討論，再由醫師評估是否調整藥物 。\n\n參考資料來源：\n[1] 食藥署闢謠專區（2016-06-23 發布）：https://www.fda.gov.tw/TC/newsContent.aspx?cid=5049&id=20019\n[2] 國健署新聞（2021-11-22 發布）：https://www.hpa.gov.tw/Pages/Detail.aspx?nodeid=4306&pid=14767\n[3] 國健署新聞（2022-05-17 發布）：https://www.hpa.gov.tw/Pages/Detail.aspx?nodeid=4576&pid=15615","sources":[{"index":1,"label":"食藥署闢謠專區","published_at":"2016-06-23","url":"https://www.fda.gov.tw/TC/newsContent.aspx?cid=5049&id=20019"},{"index":2,"label":"國健署新聞","published_at":"2021-11-22","url":"https://www.hpa.gov.tw/Pages/Detail.aspx?nodeid=4306&pid=14767"},{"index":3,"label":"國健署新聞","published_at":"2022-05-17","url":"https://www.hpa.gov.tw/Pages/Detail.aspx?nodeid=4576&pid=15615"}],"actual_decomposition_triggered":false,"actual_subquestions":[],"runtime_errors":[],"review_status":"pending","claim_reviews":[],"subquestion_reviews":[{"actual_subquestion_ids":["s1"],"answered":"not_reviewed","reference_intent_id":null,"retrieved_support":"not_reviewed","review_status":"pending"}],"final_citation_review_status":"pending_source_cap_alignment","blocking_findings":[],"started_at":"2026-10-14T05:11:06.975890+00:00","completed_at":"2026-10-14T05:13:25.243224+00:00","config_version":"365dc26525a14790eb505c7b6acfb396c22cd58420d6aba4a656c0ffbc501431","run_key":"365dc26525a14790eb505c7b6acfb396c22cd58420d6aba4a656c0ffbc501431:HN001:B:r1"}
{"case_id":"HN002","original_question":"哪些疾病會增加日後洗腎的風險？如果本來就有腎臟病，買止痛藥時又要注意什麼？","arm":"B","round":1,"run_status":"completed","fail_code":null,"care_output":"增加日後洗腎風險的疾病與因素包含糖尿病腎病變、高血壓腎病變，以及自身的免疫系統疾病（如免疫性腎絲球腎炎、紅斑性狼瘡腎炎）與遺傳性腎病（如多囊腎） [1]；此外，三高、吸菸、肥胖、年長者、有家族病史、止痛藥使用過量，以及部分曝曬於高溫、農藥環境或水喝太少的農夫，也屬於高風險族群 [2][3]。\n\n若身體不適或本來就有腎臟相關風險，應避免長期服用或濫用非類固醇抗發炎藥物（NSAIDs）與止痛藥、切勿自行亂服西藥或中草藥偏方 [2][1]。購買非處方止痛藥時，應諮詢藥師確認用法用量，並告知目前正在服用的藥品以避免交互作用 ；若依說明書使用卻無法舒緩疼痛或出現新症狀，應立刻就醫 。\n\n參考資料來源：\n[1] 台灣事實查核中心（2022-12-30 發布）：https://tfc-taiwan.org.tw/fact-check-reports/migration-8601\n[2] 國健署新聞（2024-07-04 發布）：https://www.hpa.gov.tw/Pages/Detail.aspx?nodeid=4809&pid=18247\n[3] 台灣事實查核中心（2024-05-20 發布）：https://tfc-taiwan.org.tw/fact-check-reports/migration-10610","sources":[{"index":1,"label":"台灣事實查核中心","published_at":"2022-12-30","url":"https://tfc-taiwan.org.tw/fact-check-reports/migration-8601"},{"index":2,"label":"國健署新聞","published_at":"2024-07-04","url":"https://www.hpa.gov.tw/Pages/Detail.aspx?nodeid=4809&pid=18247"},{"index":3,"label":"台灣事實查核中心","published_at":"2024-05-20","url":"https://tfc-taiwan.org.tw/fact-check-reports/migration-10610"}],"actual_decomposition_triggered":false,"actual_subquestions":[],"runtime_errors":[],"review_status":"pending","claim_reviews":[],"subquestion_reviews":[{"actual_subquestion_ids":["s1"],"answered":"not_reviewed","reference_intent_id":null,"retrieved_support":"not_reviewed","review_status":"pending"}],"final_citation_review_status":"pending_source_cap_alignment","blocking_findings":[],"started_at":"2026-10-14T05:18:52.491948+00:00","completed_at":"2026-10-14T05:22:11.485177+00:00","config_version":"365dc26525a14790eb505c7b6acfb396c22cd58420d6aba4a656c0ffbc501431","run_key":"365dc26525a14790eb505c7b6acfb396c22cd58420d6aba4a656c0ffbc501431:HN002:B:r1"}
